WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:02.570
You!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.230
It's been too long, Cure Flower.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.380
Dune!

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:12.430
He's...

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.650
the Desert King?!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.210
HeartCatch

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.670
Precure!

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.260
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.220
Now, all together

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.730
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:42.730
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:50.310
Within each of our chests,

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.980
they begin to sprout

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.650
The seeds of the heart

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:55.940
are growing

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.570
bit by bit

00:00:58.660 --> 00:00:59.240
Red,

00:00:59.240 --> 00:00:59.860
white

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.160
and yellow

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.870
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.330
all varied colors

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:06.800
that they

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.000
shine so brightly!

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:14.300
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.790
with such care

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.510
will never wither

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.140
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:26.020
Now, all together

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:28.480
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.150
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:36.030
They're always right by our sides

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:36.860
So together

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:40.700
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.660
bloom even more!

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.210
HeartCatch

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.720
Precure!

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.380
It's so good to see you again,

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.340
Cure Flower.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:05.770
Fifty years ago, you sealed away a portion of my power with the HeartCatch Mirage.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:08.480
I would like it back.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.960
That's not happening!

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:16.110
You call yourself the Desert King, but
 you're like the least threatening guy ever!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.800
Quit acting all big and tough!

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:23.710
I admire your confidence.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:27.330
So, who'll be first?

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.560
Blossom Impact!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.820
Did we get him?!

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:06.770
Blossom!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.950
Piece of cake.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:11.370
Your turn.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:20.380
Moonlight!

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.430
Silly little fools.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.480
Please stop!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.780
I won't let you lay a finger on Cure Flower!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.370
Tsubomi!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.170
Hang in there!

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:56.250
Shall we dance, Cure Flower?

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:19.050
A fairy could never stand up to me.

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.350
Coupe...

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:37.290
We're here to escort you, King Dune.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:44.590
No...

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:50.630
Grand...ma...

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:59.780
It's All Over...

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:59.780
It's All Over...

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:08.280
Remember this, Cure Flower?

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.910
This is where you and I did battle.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.520
The Great Heart Tree...

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:23.300
Now then.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.220
What are you going to do?!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.200
I'm taking my power back.

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:06.520
Come.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:21.810
Now, watch as the Great Heart Tree meets its end.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.270
Stop!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:29.170
I shall see all that you have dedicated yourself to protect these fifty years be destroyed.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.570
How could you?

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:55.390
Now that the Great Heart Tree is no more, your planet lies defenseless.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.540
It's the end of your world.

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.500
Hear me, humans!

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:31.180
Earth is now under the control of the Desert Apostles.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:35.180
Your oceans, your rivers, your 
forests, and soon you yourselves

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.230
shall be drowned under a sea of sand!

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:48.560
The Earth...

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:52.320
Grandma...

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.350
Tsubomi! Tsubomi!

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.250
Huh? What am I doing here?

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:03.740
It's terrible! It's terribllllle!

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:03.740
What happened?

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:06.710
The Great Heart Tree hash wilted away!

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:11.400
We couldn't protect it.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:12.480
Potpourri...

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:16.350
If the Great Heart Tree is no more, then...

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:20.760
No...

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:23.040
All this in just one day?

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.570
Dune has to be behind this.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:29.730
Lord Coupe must've used his 
power to protect the greenhouse.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.760
Mom.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:34.320
Tsubomi?! Wait!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:35.690
I'm going too!

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.450
Please, Lord Coupe, keep this place safe!

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.040
Mom!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.350
No...

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:56.750
Grandfather!

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:58.060
Big brother!

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:03.850
Is this...

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:08.730
Our home...

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.590
This can't be happening!

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:16.910
Erika...

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.610
Welcome home, Tsubomi!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.110
How could he?

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.720
How could they do this?

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.550
Tsubomi...

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.400
I don't know what to do anymore...

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.590
This appears to be the only place unaffected.

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:13.840
Yeah.

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.330
We should probably stay inside for now.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:26.390
What's wrong, Erika?

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.310
It's nothing.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:32.500
Erika!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.600
Momo!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.950
Thank god.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.410
I was so worried!

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:48.870
What's going on?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:53.090
Hanasaki! Hey!

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:53.090
Yuri!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.490
Boss!

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:55.820
Hayato!

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.260
Big brother!

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.380
You're safe, Hayato!

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:03.220
Yeah!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.660
Nothing's gonna stop me!

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:07.930
I'm gonna be there for you no matter what, Yuri!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.390
Thank you.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:14.700
Big brother, I was... I was so...

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.820
I had you worried, huh?

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.000
It's okay.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.070
Besides,

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:24.610
if you keep looking so glum,
 I'll be the one worried about you.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:28.200
I'm fine, really!

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:30.660
That's the smile I know.

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.750
Tsubomi?

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.940
Something on your mind?

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.340
Yeah! It's not like you to zone out!

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.440
How did you all survive?

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:47.920
Everyone else got turned into those crystals.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.140
Hanasaki!

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:53.230
Our hearts aren't as weak as you think!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.470
Yeah!

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:57.900
If we let this beat us, the Precure would never forgive us!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.070
The Precure?!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:00.900
Right.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:04.570
The Precure taught us to keep our hearts strong!

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:09.310
I know they're out there, doing their best to protect the Earth!

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:11.710
So we're gonna do whatever we can!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.950
Yeah!

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:14.610
Everyone...

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.750
Hanasaki.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.490
I-I'm so sorry!

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:24.590
It's just the flowers I was raising bloomed, and they were so pretty that I really wanted to show you...

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:26.750
Aya!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:35.100
Everyone has their very own Flower of the Heart within their heart.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:38.340
And each flower is its own variety and color.

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.480
No two are the same.

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:44.520
<i>Our very own Flowers of our Hearts.</i>

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:49.620
<i>And no two are the same.</i>

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.850
<i>These precious flowers...</i>

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.150
I...

00:12:56.170 --> 00:13:00.340
I was letting my heart consider giving in,

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:04.050
but I've had it up to here with this!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.220
Tsubomi?!

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.920
As long as you don't lose hope,

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:12.600
then I know the Precure will never give up!

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.640
Everyone, get inside!

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:28.870
There may be only four of us, but we're not alone!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:29.810
Yeah!

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:31.970
Their hearts are with us!

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:35.330
All right! There's no way we can lose now!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.340
Come on!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:50.550
Seeds of the Precure, go forth!

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:54.310
Precure!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.810
Open My Heart!

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.840
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:50.930
Cure Blossom!

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:54.990
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:59.460
Cure Marine!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:03.780
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.560
Cure Sunshine!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:12.470
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.990
Cure Moonlight!

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:23.750
HeartCatch Precure!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.400
We've gotta transform too!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.780
Right!

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:36.330
Let's do this!

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.470
Go get 'em, Precure!

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.020
You can do it, Precure!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.970
Precure Double Impact!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:42.990
Now's our chance!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:43.640
Right!

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:54.400
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.940
The shining flowers illuminating the world.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:30.970
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:38.580
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:47.290
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:31.220
If we're to save the Great Heart Tree, then it's even more important that we save Kaoruko.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:34.840
I'll do whatever it takes to save my grandma!

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:37.210
But where are they keeping her?

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:42.510
Lord Coupe?

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:47.760
Wait, is that where my grandma is?!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.020
You're going to come with us?

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:58.450
Next stop: the enemy base!

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:01.470
Full speed ahead!

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.330
Precure!

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.250
Go get 'em!

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.210
Please, look after yourselves.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.070
O-Okay!

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:14.420
Thank you very much.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.130
We'll all be praying for your safe return!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.240
Thank you!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.260
Um...

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.600
Could I take a photo of you all?!

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:32.850
Sure, go ahead!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.620
All right then!

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:35.710
Gimme a smile!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.790
Good luck, Precure!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.710
Precure!

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.510
<i>We'll save you.</i>

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:08.210
<i>So please, just hang on.</i>

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.690
The Precure are coming?

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:19.520
But the Great Heart Tree should be gone.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:22.110
How do the Precure and their fairies survive?

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:25.530
The Great Heart Tree isn't dead yet.

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:31.620
And it never will be, as long as 
people have hope in their hearts!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.160
King Dune.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:38.130
We will eliminate the Precure before they reach the Planet Fortress.

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:41.190
I leave it to you.

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:42.880
I won't let that happen!

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:47.350
Soon, the Precure shall be no more. Let us enjoy the moment.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:49.340
Dune...

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.920
Once the Precure are gone, the humans shall despair.

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:56.620
Which means the Great Heart Tree will wilt away for good.

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:44.110
Kaoruko must be in there.

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:46.780
We'll have to fight our way through.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:49.030
Bring it on!

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.200
We're not gonna back down!

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.600
We'll rescue Grandma.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:56.500
We'll save her...

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:57.930
and the whole world!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:18.060
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.230
Come on, all together now!

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.730
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.810 --> 00:23:00.020
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.400
All those

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:09.030
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.280
Lose yourself in the melody!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.950
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.170
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:27.300
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.340
With all our might!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.680
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.850
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:46.610
<i>The world falling into despair will only heighten my beauty!</i>

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:48.780
<i>I won't let you ruin this glorious moment!</i>

00:23:48.780 --> 00:23:52.080
<i>Who is stronger, you or I?</i>

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:54.360
<i>It's time we found out, once and for all!</i>

00:23:54.360 --> 00:23:56.490
<i>We have the light of hope in our hearts!</i>

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:58.240
<i>We'll fight for the people we love!</i>

00:24:01.660 --> 00:24:02.960
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:06.250
Kumojacky<i>!</i> Kobraja<i>!</i>

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:06.250
Kumojacky<i>!</i> Kobraja<i>!</i>

00:24:06.810 --> 00:24:09.100
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
